{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "e32576018e81e96ed16231a80bfc0d872933c90ad277ad821790d793a4e98a91", "ja": "リリィ・クエスト ～天空の子豚～ 妖精郷", "zh": "莉莉探求 ～天空的小猪～ 妖精乡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6de42081d8c37062a911585bfb4d157ac9656748cafe17642ba51b04184cefd4", "ja": "海を、谷を、山を、そして遥かな空を超え、\nたそがれの妖精郷へとたどり着いた勇者達。\n妖精の両親と再会した星梨花は、少しセンチ\nメンタルになってしまうが、そんな気持ちを\n振り払い、遂に魔王城へと向かった。", "zh": "跨越大海、峡谷、群山，以及遥远的天空，  \n勇者们终于抵达了黄昏的妖精乡。  \n与妖精父母重逢的星梨花，变得有些多愁善感，  \n但她甩开了这份心情，终于向魔王城进发。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "ba79ea6de4e5f654e1100483e952e8b662474bf138d58f16488e490afe4c4db3", "ja": "時には、海を越えて……。", "zh": "有时候，要越过大海……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "d391911b26034aac3672d8692470eaa7f025b4cafa7f379924b7fe842ada903d", "ja": "ざっぱーん！　ここは暁の入り江です！\nロコは船乗りAです♪", "zh": "哗啦——！这里是破晓海湾！\nROCO是水手A♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "f0dda324a45951f3129a68292424fe7c2c7be34b4eb6a4a96f2ef40c3b1850d9", "ja": "時には、谷を越えて……。", "zh": "有时候，翻越山谷……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "7a9562c1070021ff4d1042e6498571f00ef363f940ea8ae58f802f2d93a04781", "ja": "あんぎゃー！　ここは竜の渓谷です！\nロコは迷子のチルドレンAです♪", "zh": "哎呀——！这里是巨龙溪谷！\nROCO是迷路的孩子A♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "5793f2302d3af260e30ebad41f019d4fd7ad71e3093fb6d0d08b47ee40342361", "ja": "時には、山を越えて……。", "zh": "有时候，要翻越高山……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "55d2bce47bd85525c806c45a164e54384133aa4b822d5af12079a0a1c285e3e0", "ja": "はあ、はあ……。\nこ、ここは古代の遺跡です！", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……\n这、这里是古代遗迹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "62085f3f0357ec2c28f054b243479586ad8cc2d07b514594a6c4c75d19fe6790", "ja": "ロコはエンシェントピーポー、千年間も\nレガシーをプロテクトしてきた古代人の末裔です～。", "zh": "ROCO是远古人，是守护了千年传承的古代人后裔～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "5724c5533557af6a883a3176140056eeefa58341e08f0af696b673725142d812", "ja": "やがては、遥かな空も越えて……。", "zh": "终将跨越遥远的天空……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "1cac50af6a35e377934219f173aed6aab6ec72a33daaec57470a3dcee18716d3", "ja": "ふう……。あ、ここはたそがれの妖精郷です！\nロコはフェアリーピーポーAです！", "zh": "呼……啊，这里是黄昏的妖精乡！\nROCO是妖精族A！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "46f03f2fc5ace4617144d5c87a04eb4b8b6c734a73215ba93ba4b1cb08649c32", "ja": "勇者として認めてもらうため、星梨花ちゃんのご両親に\n挨拶だなんて。最初は緊張したけど……。", "zh": "为了得到勇者的认可，竟然要去向星梨花的父母打招呼。虽然一开始很紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "95885cc4ca39df96e53fa614813b7504d3a464986d389484d9bec12313bc2e7a", "ja": "星梨花ちゃんのパパとママ、\nとってもステキだったね！", "zh": "星梨花的爸爸妈妈人真好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "b60f6cc18209fa6d5fdb66d8fc63328ecbaa4350ab4f357b2dd21de95c0addb8", "ja": "パパたちも安心してくれたみたいでよかったです。", "zh": "爸爸妈妈好像也放心了，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "3cac92469014d33c708f969773b609f0c80b6285c701b7ca373c3c95e5b58cf5", "ja": "魔王を倒すためのお土産もたくさんもらっちゃったね。\n勇気の指輪とか、星降るサークレットとか……。", "zh": "为了打倒魔王，我们还收到了好多特产呢。勇气之戒、繁星降落的冠冕什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "68c383c3a71110223671a385cd14c7909e097e8d258361da3e18de8a612a5a88", "ja": "この光ってるドレスは、星梨花ちゃんのかな？", "zh": "这件闪闪发光的礼服，是星梨花的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "cd82d69e1eb1d6d5e7f1bf7643a2f184530a0ecb9bec7ae022e21b6eeb68556f", "ja": "あっ、これは……星梨花の、妖精の衣！", "zh": "啊，这是……星梨花的妖精之衣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "7d335a10a7b8c9a93c8b187f330dd0b8a50f18b591b27e08dc7c0eabb49954ac", "ja": "妖精の衣？", "zh": "妖精之衣？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "954916a09c1b916cffea16eba967a840f5ac32f05f386a67744878d22f3a60a3", "ja": "妖精族は、生まれたその日から、\n母親が魔法の衣を織り始めるんです……。", "zh": "精灵族从出生那天起，母亲就会开始编织魔法衣裳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "9021c1391330062277bef951648c9c4b23f3a2d57fb66f855865e05c7b99f7a6", "ja": "わたしが赤ちゃんの頃から、大人になった日のために\nって、ママがずっと……。ママ……ママ……！", "zh": "从我还是婴儿的时候起，妈妈就为了我长大成人的那一天\n一直……妈妈……妈妈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "5f10911b02eb1bf57ab5890a45a0029c9ff9ffb3785da58db9130824e84776bb", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん……。\nもう少し妖精の国でゆっくりしていく？", "zh": "星梨花……  \n要不要再在妖精国里多待一会儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "9017a3db4390f823f6f821ee96959ed72fc601e9b22bbe8eb2a291f93ca245fa", "ja": "ぐすっ。いいえ、わたしにはやることがありますから。\nここで引き返したら、きっとパパもママも悲しみます。", "zh": "呜……不，我还有必须要做的事。\n如果现在回头，爸爸和妈妈一定会伤心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "6637289a8d8e014e3e1b0ce624f3f44af134420d7751d223adb8927bd4e13f9e", "ja": "行きましょう、百合子さん。\n魔王のお城まで、あと少しです！", "zh": "我们走吧，百合子姐姐。\n距离魔王的城堡已经不远了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "65ef25df8829b334da3316acdc9b74d4c0d907284cecee8f2062aeb2e40bc48a", "ja": "……星梨花ちゃん。\nうん、そうだね！", "zh": "……星梨花。\n嗯，说得对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "e8bb2b63873e9f96ae59df66d5c4703aa08662cfce3bcb5cae129146f70f9b47", "ja": "追いかけてくる謎の生物から、泥だらけになって\n逃げ回ったことも、大切な人達との出会いと別れも。", "zh": "我们曾被追赶而来的神秘生物弄得满身泥泞，\n四处逃窜；也曾与重要的人们相遇、分别。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_03_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "7b067d04e0b29bc569ad72420895cea0ccd11e4e0abfe5679b884f559677e5e4", "ja": "ひとつひとつを思い出にして私達は進んでいきました。\nいよいよ、魔王の居城目前です！", "zh": "我们将这一件件都化作回忆，继续向前迈进。\n终于，我们就要抵达魔王的城堡了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
